+   * complete "Gesamteindruck" of the element even when that makes it small. The
+   * element is rendered at a fixed desktop width (PREVIEW_RENDER_WIDTH) and scaled
+   * down by the smaller of the width- and height-fit, then centred in the box (so
+   * the entire element is always visible, never cropped). Never upscale past 1:1.
+   * Same-origin preview, so contentDocument is readable; bail on any access error.
+   * @param {HTMLIFrameElement} iframe
+   */
