+   * needs a scrollbar. The stage box is set to the exact scaled content size and
+   * the flyout is nudged vertically next to its trigger (clamped on screen).
+   * Same-origin preview, so contentDocument is readable; fall back to the CSS
+   * defaults on any access error.
+   * @param {Event} event iframe load event
+   */
